{"id":74,"name":"المدثر","transliteration":"Al-Muddaththir","translation_fr":"Celui qui se couvre","translation_en":"The Cloaked One","type":"meccan","total_verses":56,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلۡمُدَّثِّرُ","translation_fr":"O, toi (Muhammad)! Le revêtu d'un manteau","translation_en":"O you who covers himself [with a garment]","transliteration":"Ya ayyuha almuddaththiru"},{"id":2,"text":"قُمۡ فَأَنذِرۡ","translation_fr":"Lève-toi et avertis","translation_en":"Arise and warn","transliteration":"Qum faanthir"},{"id":3,"text":"وَرَبَّكَ فَكَبِّرۡ","translation_fr":"Et de ton Seigneur, célèbre la grandeur","translation_en":"And your Lord glorify","transliteration":"Warabbaka fakabbir"},{"id":4,"text":"وَثِيَابَكَ فَطَهِّرۡ","translation_fr":"Et tes vêtements, purifie-les","translation_en":"And your clothing purify","transliteration":"Wathiyabaka fatahhir"},{"id":5,"text":"وَٱلرُّجۡزَ فَٱهۡجُرۡ","translation_fr":"Et de tout péché, écarte-toi","translation_en":"And uncleanliness avoid","transliteration":"Waalrrujza faohjur"},{"id":6,"text":"وَلَا تَمۡنُن تَسۡتَكۡثِرُ","translation_fr":"Et ne donne pas dans le but de recevoir davantage","translation_en":"And do not confer favor to acquire more","transliteration":"Wala tamnun tastakthiru"},{"id":7,"text":"وَلِرَبِّكَ فَٱصۡبِرۡ","translation_fr":"Et pour ton Seigneur, endure","translation_en":"But for your Lord be patient","transliteration":"Walirabbika faisbir"},{"id":8,"text":"فَإِذَا نُقِرَ فِي ٱلنَّاقُورِ","translation_fr":"Quand on sonnera du Clairon","translation_en":"And when the trumpet is blown","transliteration":"Faitha nuqira fee alnnaqoori"},{"id":9,"text":"فَذَٰلِكَ يَوۡمَئِذٖ يَوۡمٌ عَسِيرٌ","translation_fr":"alors, ce jour-là sera un jour difficile","translation_en":"That Day will be a difficult day","transliteration":"Fathalika yawmaithin yawmun AAaseerun"},{"id":10,"text":"عَلَى ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ غَيۡرُ يَسِيرٖ","translation_fr":"pas facile pour les mécréants","translation_en":"For the disbelievers - not easy","transliteration":"AAala alkafireena ghayru yaseerin"},{"id":11,"text":"ذَرۡنِي وَمَنۡ خَلَقۡتُ وَحِيدٗا","translation_fr":"Laisse-Moi avec celui que J'ai créé seul","translation_en":"Leave Me with the one I created alone","transliteration":"Tharnee waman khalaqtu waheedan"},{"id":12,"text":"وَجَعَلۡتُ لَهُۥ مَالٗا مَّمۡدُودٗا","translation_fr":"et à qui J'ai donné des biens étendus","translation_en":"And to whom I granted extensive wealth","transliteration":"WajaAAaltu lahu malan mamdoodan"},{"id":13,"text":"وَبَنِينَ شُهُودٗا","translation_fr":"et des enfants qui lui tiennent toujours compagnie","translation_en":"And children present [with him]","transliteration":"Wabaneena shuhoodan"},{"id":14,"text":"وَمَهَّدتُّ لَهُۥ تَمۡهِيدٗا","translation_fr":"pour qui aussi J'ai aplani toutes difficultés","translation_en":"And spread [everything] before him, easing [his life]","transliteration":"Wamahhadtu lahu tamheedan"},{"id":15,"text":"ثُمَّ يَطۡمَعُ أَنۡ أَزِيدَ","translation_fr":"Cependant, il convoite [de Moi] que Je lui donne davantage","translation_en":"Then he desires that I should add more","transliteration":"Thumma yatmaAAu an azeeda"},{"id":16,"text":"كَلَّآۖ إِنَّهُۥ كَانَ لِأٓيَٰتِنَا عَنِيدٗا","translation_fr":"Pas du tout! Car il reniait nos versets (le Coran) avec entêtement","translation_en":"No! Indeed, he has been toward Our verses obstinate","transliteration":"Kalla innahu kana liayatina AAaneedan"},{"id":17,"text":"سَأُرۡهِقُهُۥ صَعُودًا","translation_fr":"Je vais le contraindre à gravir une pente","translation_en":"I will cover him with arduous torment","transliteration":"Saorhiquhu saAAoodan"},{"id":18,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ فَكَّرَ وَقَدَّرَ","translation_fr":"Il a réfléchi. Et il a décidé","translation_en":"Indeed, he thought and deliberated","transliteration":"Innahu fakkara waqaddara"},{"id":19,"text":"فَقُتِلَ كَيۡفَ قَدَّرَ","translation_fr":"Qu'il périsse! Comme il a décidé","translation_en":"So may he be destroyed [for] how he deliberated","transliteration":"Faqutila kayfa qaddara"},{"id":20,"text":"ثُمَّ قُتِلَ كَيۡفَ قَدَّرَ","translation_fr":"Encore une fois, qu'il périsse; comme il a décidé","translation_en":"Then may he be destroyed [for] how he deliberated","transliteration":"Thumma qutila kayfa qaddara"},{"id":21,"text":"ثُمَّ نَظَرَ","translation_fr":"Ensuite, il a regardé","translation_en":"Then he considered [again]","transliteration":"Thumma nathara"},{"id":22,"text":"ثُمَّ عَبَسَ وَبَسَرَ","translation_fr":"Et il s'est renfrogné et a durci son visage","translation_en":"Then he frowned and scowled","transliteration":"Thumma AAabasa wabasara"},{"id":23,"text":"ثُمَّ أَدۡبَرَ وَٱسۡتَكۡبَرَ","translation_fr":"Ensuite il a tourné le dos et s'est enflé d'orgueil","translation_en":"Then he turned back and was arrogant","transliteration":"Thumma adbara waistakbara"},{"id":24,"text":"فَقَالَ إِنۡ هَٰذَآ إِلَّا سِحۡرٞ يُؤۡثَرُ","translation_fr":"Puis il a dit: «Ceci (le Coran) n'est que magie apprise","translation_en":"And said, \"This is not but magic imitated [from others]","transliteration":"Faqala in hatha illa sihrun yutharu"},{"id":25,"text":"إِنۡ هَٰذَآ إِلَّا قَوۡلُ ٱلۡبَشَرِ","translation_fr":"ce n'est là que la parole d'un humain»","translation_en":"This is not but the word of a human being","transliteration":"In hatha illa qawlu albashari"},{"id":26,"text":"سَأُصۡلِيهِ سَقَرَ","translation_fr":"Je vais le brûler dans le Feu intense (Saqar)","translation_en":"I will drive him into Saqar","transliteration":"Saosleehi saqara"},{"id":27,"text":"وَمَآ أَدۡرَىٰكَ مَا سَقَرُ","translation_fr":"Et qui te dira ce qu'est Saqar","translation_en":"And what can make you know what is Saqar","transliteration":"Wama adraka ma saqaru"},{"id":28,"text":"لَا تُبۡقِي وَلَا تَذَرُ","translation_fr":"Il ne laisse rien et n'épargne rien","translation_en":"It lets nothing remain and leaves nothing [unburned]","transliteration":"La tubqee wala tatharu"},{"id":29,"text":"لَوَّاحَةٞ لِّلۡبَشَرِ","translation_fr":"Il brûle la peau et la noircit","translation_en":"Blackening the skins","transliteration":"Lawwahatun lilbashari"},{"id":30,"text":"عَلَيۡهَا تِسۡعَةَ عَشَرَ","translation_fr":"Ils sont dix neuf à y veiller","translation_en":"Over it are nineteen [angels]","transliteration":"AAalayha tisAAata AAashara"},{"id":31,"text":"وَمَا جَعَلۡنَآ أَصۡحَٰبَ ٱلنَّارِ إِلَّا مَلَـٰٓئِكَةٗۖ وَمَا جَعَلۡنَا عِدَّتَهُمۡ إِلَّا فِتۡنَةٗ لِّلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ لِيَسۡتَيۡقِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُواْ ٱلۡكِتَٰبَ وَيَزۡدَادَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓاْ إِيمَٰنٗا وَلَا يَرۡتَابَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُواْ ٱلۡكِتَٰبَ وَٱلۡمُؤۡمِنُونَ وَلِيَقُولَ ٱلَّذِينَ فِي قُلُوبِهِم مَّرَضٞ وَٱلۡكَٰفِرُونَ مَاذَآ أَرَادَ ٱللَّهُ بِهَٰذَا مَثَلٗاۚ كَذَٰلِكَ يُضِلُّ ٱللَّهُ مَن يَشَآءُ وَيَهۡدِي مَن يَشَآءُۚ وَمَا يَعۡلَمُ جُنُودَ رَبِّكَ إِلَّا هُوَۚ وَمَا هِيَ إِلَّا ذِكۡرَىٰ لِلۡبَشَرِ","translation_fr":"Nous n'avons assigné comme gardiens du Feu que des Anges. Cependant, Nous n'en avons fixé le nombre que pour éprouver les mécréants, et aussi afin que ceux à qui le Livre a été apporté soient convaincus, et que croisse la foi de ceux qui croient, et que ceux à qui le Livre a été apporté et les croyants n'aient point de doute; et pour que ceux qui ont au cœur quelque maladie ainsi que les mécréants disent: «Qu'a donc voulu Allah par cette parabole?» C'est ainsi qu'Allah égare qui Il veut et guide qui Il veut. Nul ne connaît les armées de ton Seigneur, à part Lui. Et ce n'est là qu'un rappel pour les humains","translation_en":"And We have not made the keepers of the Fire except angels. And We have not made their number except as a trial for those who disbelieve - that those who were given the Scripture will be convinced and those who have believed will increase in faith and those who were given the Scripture and the believers will not doubt and that those in whose hearts is hypocrisy and the disbelievers will say, \"What does Allah intend by this as an example?\" Thus does Allah leave astray whom He wills and guides whom He wills. And none knows the soldiers of your Lord except Him. And mention of the Fire is not but a reminder to humanity","transliteration":"Wama jaAAalna ashaba alnnari illa malaikatan wama jaAAalna AAiddatahum illa fitnatan lillatheena kafaroo liyastayqina allatheena ootoo alkitaba wayazdada allatheena amanoo eemanan wala yartaba allatheena ootoo alkitaba waalmuminoona waliyaqoola allatheena fee quloobihim maradun waalkafiroona matha arada Allahu bihatha mathalan kathalika yudillu Allahu man yashao wayahdee man yashao wama yaAAlamu junooda rabbika illa huwa wama hiya illa thikra lilbashari"},{"id":32,"text":"كَلَّا وَٱلۡقَمَرِ","translation_fr":"Non!... Par la lune","translation_en":"No! By the moon","transliteration":"Kalla waalqamari"},{"id":33,"text":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذۡ أَدۡبَرَ","translation_fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle se retire","translation_en":"And [by] the night when it departs","transliteration":"Waallayli ith adbara"},{"id":34,"text":"وَٱلصُّبۡحِ إِذَآ أَسۡفَرَ","translation_fr":"Et par l'aurore quand elle se découvre","translation_en":"And [by] the morning when it brightens","transliteration":"Waalssubhi itha asfara"},{"id":35,"text":"إِنَّهَا لَإِحۡدَى ٱلۡكُبَرِ","translation_fr":"[Saqar] est l'un des plus grands [malheurs]","translation_en":"Indeed, the Fire is of the greatest [afflictions]","transliteration":"Innaha laihda alkubari"},{"id":36,"text":"نَذِيرٗا لِّلۡبَشَرِ","translation_fr":"un avertissement, pour les humains","translation_en":"As a warning to humanity","transliteration":"Natheeran lilbashari"},{"id":37,"text":"لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمۡ أَن يَتَقَدَّمَ أَوۡ يَتَأَخَّرَ","translation_fr":"Pour qui d'entre vous, veut avancer ou reculer","translation_en":"To whoever wills among you to proceed or stay behind","transliteration":"Liman shaa minkum an yataqaddama aw yataakhkhara"},{"id":38,"text":"كُلُّ نَفۡسِۭ بِمَا كَسَبَتۡ رَهِينَةٌ","translation_fr":"Toute âme est l'otage de ce qu'elle a acquis","translation_en":"Every soul, for what it has earned, will be retained","transliteration":"Kullu nafsin bima kasabat raheenatun"},{"id":39,"text":"إِلَّآ أَصۡحَٰبَ ٱلۡيَمِينِ","translation_fr":"Sauf les gens de la droite (les élus)","translation_en":"Except the companions of the right","transliteration":"Illa ashaba alyameeni"},{"id":40,"text":"فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","translation_fr":"dans des Jardins, ils s'interrogeront","translation_en":"[Who will be] in gardens, questioning each other","transliteration":"Fee jannatin yatasaaloona"},{"id":41,"text":"عَنِ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ","translation_fr":"au sujet des criminels","translation_en":"About the criminals","transliteration":"AAani almujrimeena"},{"id":42,"text":"مَا سَلَكَكُمۡ فِي سَقَرَ","translation_fr":"«Qu'est-ce qui vous a acheminés à Saqar?»","translation_en":"[And asking them], \"What put you into Saqar","transliteration":"Ma salakakum fee saqara"},{"id":43,"text":"قَالُواْ لَمۡ نَكُ مِنَ ٱلۡمُصَلِّينَ","translation_fr":"Ils diront: «Nous n'étions pas de ceux qui faisaient la Salât","translation_en":"They will say, \"We were not of those who prayed","transliteration":"Qaloo lam naku mina almusalleena"},{"id":44,"text":"وَلَمۡ نَكُ نُطۡعِمُ ٱلۡمِسۡكِينَ","translation_fr":"et nous ne nourrissions pas le pauvre","translation_en":"Nor did we used to feed the poor","transliteration":"Walam naku nutAAimu almiskeena"},{"id":45,"text":"وَكُنَّا نَخُوضُ مَعَ ٱلۡخَآئِضِينَ","translation_fr":"et nous nous associions à ceux qui tenaient des conversations futiles","translation_en":"And we used to enter into vain discourse with those who engaged [in it]","transliteration":"Wakunna nakhoodu maAAa alkhaideena"},{"id":46,"text":"وَكُنَّا نُكَذِّبُ بِيَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"et nous traitions de mensonge le jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"And we used to deny the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Wakunna nukaththibu biyawmi alddeeni"},{"id":47,"text":"حَتَّىٰٓ أَتَىٰنَا ٱلۡيَقِينُ","translation_fr":"jusqu'à ce que nous vînt la vérité évidente [la mort]»","translation_en":"Until there came to us the certainty","transliteration":"Hatta atana alyaqeenu"},{"id":48,"text":"فَمَا تَنفَعُهُمۡ شَفَٰعَةُ ٱلشَّـٰفِعِينَ","translation_fr":"Ne leur profitera point donc, l'intercession des intercesseurs","translation_en":"So there will not benefit them the intercession of [any] intercessors","transliteration":"Fama tanfaAAuhum shafaAAatu alshshafiAAeena"},{"id":49,"text":"فَمَا لَهُمۡ عَنِ ٱلتَّذۡكِرَةِ مُعۡرِضِينَ","translation_fr":"Qu'ont-ils à se détourner du Rappel","translation_en":"Then what is [the matter] with them that they are, from the reminder, turning away","transliteration":"Fama lahum AAani alttathkirati muAArideena"},{"id":50,"text":"كَأَنَّهُمۡ حُمُرٞ مُّسۡتَنفِرَةٞ","translation_fr":"Ils sont comme des onagres épouvantés","translation_en":"As if they were alarmed donkeys","transliteration":"Kaannahum humurun mustanfiratun"},{"id":51,"text":"فَرَّتۡ مِن قَسۡوَرَةِۭ","translation_fr":"s'enfuyant devant un lion","translation_en":"Fleeing from a lion","transliteration":"Farrat min qaswaratin"},{"id":52,"text":"بَلۡ يُرِيدُ كُلُّ ٱمۡرِيٕٖ مِّنۡهُمۡ أَن يُؤۡتَىٰ صُحُفٗا مُّنَشَّرَةٗ","translation_fr":"Chacun d'eux voudrait plutôt qu'on lui apporte des feuilles tout étalées","translation_en":"Rather, every person among them desires that he would be given scriptures spread about","transliteration":"Bal yureedu kullu imriin minhum an yuta suhufan munashsharatan"},{"id":53,"text":"كَلَّاۖ بَل لَّا يَخَافُونَ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةَ","translation_fr":"Ah! Non! C'est plutôt qu'ils ne craignent pas l'au-delà","translation_en":"No! But they do not fear the Hereafter","transliteration":"Kalla bal la yakhafoona alakhirata"},{"id":54,"text":"كَلَّآ إِنَّهُۥ تَذۡكِرَةٞ","translation_fr":"Ah! Non! Ceci est vraiment un Rappel","translation_en":"No! Indeed, the Qur'an is a reminder","transliteration":"Kalla innahu tathkiratun"},{"id":55,"text":"فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ","translation_fr":"Quiconque veut, qu'il se le rappelle","translation_en":"Then whoever wills will remember it","transliteration":"Faman shaa thakarahu"},{"id":56,"text":"وَمَا يَذۡكُرُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُۚ هُوَ أَهۡلُ ٱلتَّقۡوَىٰ وَأَهۡلُ ٱلۡمَغۡفِرَةِ","translation_fr":"Mais ils ne se rappelleront que si Allah veut. C'est Lui qui est Le plus digne d'être craint; et c'est Lui qui détient le pardon","translation_en":"And they will not remember except that Allah wills. He is worthy of fear and adequate for [granting] forgiveness","transliteration":"Wama yathkuroona illa an yashaa Allahu huwa ahlu alttaqwa waahlu almaghfirati"}]}